
>> shop := (Puke-wehewehe hou
	waiho: ['magazine'] ma: ['books'],
	waiho: ['computer'] ma: ['electronics'],
	waiho: ['lipstick'] ma: ['cosmetics']
).
Huapuka kākau: (shop loaʻa: ['computer']), laina-hou. 
Huapuka kākau: (shop loaʻa: ['sausage']), laina-hou. 
Huapuka kākau: (shop loaʻa: ['computers']), laina-hou. 
Huapuka kākau: (shop loaʻa: ['compute']), laina-hou. 
Huapuka kākau: (shop loaʻa: ['2computer']), laina-hou. 
